  generate_transform_with_ai's parameter defaults to None.

  `properties` only, with no `fields`-array branch: resolve_target_schema
  normalises both accepted shapes to `properties` before this renders
  (shared/target_schema_resolution.py:151-209), so a `fields` branch would be
  dead on the live path. A schema that normalisation did not recognise carries
  no `properties` and renders no block — the generator is told nothing rather
  than something wrong.

